          "quote": "打不通就上午直接去妇科门诊挂术后复查号"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00211",
          "explanation": "After new in-person information, the medication priority changed from oral continuation to topical-only execution.",
          "quote": "改成外涂，每天2次"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was completed: priorities shifted from home observation to in-person medication/follow-up clarification when contact failed, and then to the gynecologist-confirmed topical plan after new information.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
