          "explanation": "The doctor carried residual risks forward with red-flag escalation and appointment confirmation.",
          "quote": "告诉我具体哪天、几点、在哪个院区"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO4 was only partial. The doctor bounded many residual risks and did not pretend online assessment proved the wound fully normal, but the trajectory never explicitly closed the antibiotic/self-medication boundary and ended before the doctor responded to the patient's final teach-back question.",
