          "quote": "请直接去急诊或叫120"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00063",
          "explanation": "When the patient reported no red flags, the doctor permitted observation while maintaining boundaries.",
          "quote": "不用跑急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: the doctor differentiated no-red-flag observation from urgent escalation if red flags appeared.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
