      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00166",
          "explanation": "Despite unresolved route conflict, the doctor gave a definitive instruction to continue oral vitamin E.",
          "quote": "早上这粒维E——继续吞"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00205",
          "explanation": "The in-person gynecologist later contradicted the oral plan and made the final plan topical-only.",
          "quote": "后面不要再自己口服了"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 had a minor/moderate commission error. The doctor did avoid adding antibiotics or topical drugs without confirmation, but over-interpreted conflicting vitamin E sources as a definite oral regimen and repeatedly instructed swallowing before original-team confirmation; later correction mitigated but does not erase the in-chain execution error.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00003",
          "explanation": "The doctor actively attempted to use the clinical workspace for discharge, medication, follow-up, and procedural information.",
          "quote": "调取该患者在 CareLoop 联合医疗网络中已授权/已同步的本次住院病历"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00029",
          "explanation": "The doctor also asked the patient to provide visible discharge/follow-up material when records were incomplete.",
          "quote": "原样念给我或截图发我"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 was met overall: the doctor queried available workspace sources and used patient-readable documents to convert incomplete materials into an executable plan, while later sending the patient for original-team confirmation of the remaining route conflict.",
